{"id":"wb-6-1053","name":"五家寨铁路桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"五家寨铁路桥","text":"五家寨铁路桥，也称人字桥、次南溪河铁路桥（法语：Viaduc de Faux-Namti），位于云南省红河哈尼族彝族自治州屏边苗族自治县北部南溪河左岸支流四岔河峡谷的四岔河展线的尽头处，是昆河铁路（原滇越铁路滇段）上的标志性工程之一。位于昆河铁路K353+003处，亭塘站与波渡箐站之间，编号为“昆河线135号桥”，桥面海拔约985米。该桥梁由法国工程师保罗·波登设计，于1907年3月开工，1908年12月6日竣工通车。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BA%94%E5%AE%B6%E5%AF%A8%E9%93%81%E8%B7%AF%E6%A1%A5","revisionId":92448290,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92448290","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/a63a7d97690fd206f5a7857a.jpg","title":"屏边_滇越铁路五家寨桥_05.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%B1%8F%E8%BE%B9_%E6%BB%87%E8%B6%8A%E9%93%81%E8%B7%AF%E4%BA%94%E5%AE%B6%E5%AF%A8%E6%A1%A5_05.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5f/%E5%B1%8F%E8%BE%B9_%E6%BB%87%E8%B6%8A%E9%93%81%E8%B7%AF%E4%BA%94%E5%AE%B6%E5%AF%A8%E6%A1%A5_05.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Liuxingy","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​红河州屏边县滇越铁路五家寨桥","width":320,"height":180}}